Show the reasons behind every quality indicator.

Do not label a provider's data as independently validated simply because it passed basic checks.

## 6.5 Environmental trends

Where sufficient historical data exists, show meaningful trends over time.

Do not create historical climate trends from a single current reading or a short forecast.

Clearly identify whether a chart represents historical observations, historical model data, forecasts, or sample data.

Never use seeded values as real historical evidence.

